{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAT","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"马太福音","commonName":"马太福音","title":"马太福音","order":40,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"c4984865a36f81138c82e61e1ff8ed1131c1d78b1c80e0f356cd59b636f5dd42","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1069},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣受试探"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当时，耶稣被圣灵引到旷野，受魔鬼的试探。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他禁食四十昼夜，后来就饿了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["那试探人的进前来，对他说：「你若是 神的儿子，可以吩咐这些石头变成食物。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶稣却回答说：「经上记着说：",{"text":"人活着，不是单靠食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是靠 神口里所出的一切话。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["魔鬼就带他进了圣城，叫他站在殿顶",{"noteId":3},"上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["对他说：「你若是 神的儿子，可以跳下去，因为经上记着说：",{"text":"主要为你吩咐他的使者","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用手托着你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你的脚碰在石头上。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶稣对他说：「经上又记着说：『不可试探主—你的 神。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["魔鬼又带他上了一座最高的山，将世上的万国与万国的荣华都指给他看，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["对他说：「你若俯伏拜我，我就把这一切都赐给你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶稣说：「撒但",{"noteId":4},"，退去吧！因为经上记着说：",{"text":"当拜主—你的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"单要事奉他。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["于是，魔鬼离了耶稣，有天使来伺候他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["开始在加利利传道"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶稣听见约翰下了监，就退到加利利去；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["后又离开拿撒勒，往迦百农去，就住在那里。那地方靠海，在西布伦和拿弗他利的边界上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["这是要应验先知以赛亚的话，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["说：",{"text":"西布伦地，拿弗他利地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是沿海的路，约旦河外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人的加利利地—","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那坐在黑暗里的百姓看见了大光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在死荫之地的人有光发现照着他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["从那时候，耶稣就传起道来，说：「天国近了，你们应当悔改！」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼召四个渔夫"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶稣在加利利海边行走，看见弟兄二人，就是那称呼彼得的西门和他兄弟安得烈，在海里撒网；他们本是打鱼的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶稣对他们说：「来跟从我，我要叫你们得人如得鱼一样。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["他们就立刻舍了网，跟从了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["从那里往前走，又看见弟兄二人，就是西庇太的儿子雅各和他兄弟约翰，同他们的父亲西庇太在船上补网，耶稣就招呼他们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["他们立刻舍了船，别了父亲，跟从了耶稣。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶稣向广大的群众传道"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["耶稣走遍加利利，在各会堂里教训人，传天国的福音，医治百姓各样的病症。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他的名声就传遍了叙利亚。那里的人把一切害病的，就是害各样疾病、各样疼痛的和被鬼附的、癫痫的、瘫痪的，都带了来，耶稣就治好了他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["当下，有许多人从加利利、低加坡里、耶路撒冷、犹太、约旦河外来跟着他。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"顶：原文是翅","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":5}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"就是抵挡的意思，乃魔鬼的别名","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/MAT/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}